      "text": "### SR UNIVERSITY\n\n### ACADEMIC CALENDAR FOR ACADEMIC YEAR 2026-27\n\n### B.Tech VII & VIII Semesters (Fourth Year)\n\n### 1. VII Semester (Odd Semester) Schedule\n\n- Commencement of Classwork: 10 August 2026\n\n- First Spell of Instructions: 10 August 2026 to 03 October 2026 (8 Weeks)\n\n- Mid-Semester Examination I: 05 October 2026 to 10 October 2026 (1 Week)\n\n- Second Spell of Instructions: 12 October 2026 to 28 November 2026 (7 Weeks)\n\n- Mid-Semester Examination II: 30 November 2026 to 05 December 2026 (1 Week)\n\n- Practical Examinations and Preparation Holidays: 07 December 2026 to 15 December 2026\n\n- Semester End Theory Examinations (SEE): 16 December 2026 to 30 December 2026\n\n- Semester Break / Winter Vacation: 31 December 2026 to 17 January 2027",
